<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">1 Thessalonikate</book>
  <para style="h">1 Thessalonikate</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Thessalonikate</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Thessalonikate</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Thessalonikate</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paul, Silvana leh Timothi in, Pa Pathian leh Toupa Jesu Khrist a Thessalonika khua a om saptuamte kiang ah, Hehpihna leh lemna na kiang uah om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka thumna uah na min uh lou in, nou tengteng ziak in Pathian kiang ah kipahthu ka gen gige uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I Pathian leh Pa ma ah gin ziak a na thilhih dan uh, it ziak a na sepgimte uh, Toupa Jesu Khrist lametna ziak a na kuhkalna uh mangngilh lou a, theigige in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Unau Pathian ngaihtakte aw, nou a hon teldan ka thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka Tanchinhoih uh thu kia a na kiang uh hong tunglou in thilhihtheihna leh Kha Siangthou leh nakpi a theihchetna toh a hongtung zaw hi. Noumau makhua ngaihtuah in na tung uah bangchibang mi ka hita ua chih na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huan thu haksa thuak kawm in, Kha Siangthou a kipakin na pom ua, koumau leh Toupa zuite na hita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in Masidonia leh Akhaia gam a gingta mi tengteng ading in zuihding na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa thu noumau a kipan in Masidonia leh Akhaia gam kia hilou in, munchih ah Pathian lam a na ginna uh a thangkheta hi, kou bangmah ka gen uh a kiphamoh nawn kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amau mahmah in bangchibang vualzawlna toh na kiang ua ka hong lutdan uh a hon theisak uhi. Nou milimte a kipan a Pathian lam n’ong ngattak dan uleh Pathian hing leh dik nasem ding leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />van a kipan A Tapa na ngak ding in, tua Tapa bel misi lak a kipan a a kaihthoh, thangpaihna hongtung ding lak a hon suaktasakpa Jesu ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Unaute aw, na lak ua ka honglutna uh a thawnkei chih noumau mah in na thei uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A thawn hih naksang in huai malam in na theihsa bang un, Philippi khua ah gimthuak leh zumhuaitaka bawl a ka om nung un, dalna thupitak lak ah leng Pathian Tanchinhoih na kiang ua gen ding in ka Pathian uah hangsanna ka nei zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka thugen uh zekhemna a pawt ahi kei a, sianlouhna a suak leng ahi kei a, zekhemna in leng ahi sam kei hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tanchinhoih kepsaka om ding a Pathian hoihsak mi ka hih bang ngei un, mihing hih kipak ding hilou a, ka lungtang uh ze-etpa Pathian hih kipak zaw in thu ka genzel uh a hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chiklaipeuh in kimaitang phatna thu leh huaiham khuhmangna ding thu ka zong ngeikei uh chih na thei ua; Pathian leng hon theihpihpa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khrist sawltak ka hihziak un mi ading in chimtakhuaipi hithei mahle ung, mihing lak ah nou lak ah leh midangte lak ah leng pahtawina ka zong ngei sam kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nu naupom, amah tate deihthoh tak a kem bang in, na lak uah nunnem tak in ka omzaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in ittaka nou k’on lunggulh tuntun ziak un, Pathian Tanchinhoih kia hilou in, koumau hinna leng honpiak hial ka ut mahmah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Unaute aw, ka sep tawldan uleh ka sepgim dan uh na theigige uhi; na lak uah kuamah ka suk tuailuai louhna ding un, sun leh zana nasem in Pathian Tanchinhoih nou k’on hilh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nou gingtate tung a siangthou tak, diktak leh dembei a ka omdan uh a hon theihpihte Pathian leh noute na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na theih mah bang un, Pa’n amah tate tung a ahihbanga hanthawn leh khamuan in nou k’on theisak uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amah gam leh thupina a nou hon samlutpa Pathian mi hidia kilawm him a na hin theihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hiai ziak in tawplou in Pathian kiang ah kipahthu ka gen uhi, Pathian thu koumau a kipan a na muh uh, na sanlai un leng, mihing thu bang in na sangkei ua; Pathian thu a hihna bang a na sanzawk ziak un; huai Pathian a ahi hima, gingtami noumau sung a semzel mah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nou unaute aw, Judia gam a Pathian saptuam pawl Khrist Jesu a omte zuite na hi ua, amau Judate lak a thuak bang un, nou leng noumau gam mite lak ah na thuak sam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huai Judate’n Toupa Jesu leh zawlneite leng a that ua, kou leng a hon delhkhia ua, Pathian a sulungkim kei ua, mi tengteng a kalh nak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jentelte hotdam a hihtheihna ding ua a kiang ua thugen a kham ua, a khelhna uh hihdim gige ding in; himahleh thangpaihna a khawk theihtawpin a tung uah a hongtungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Himahleh unaute aw, sawtlou kal a dia noumau toh lungtang lam a kikhenlou a, sapum lam kia a kikhen a i omtakdih ziak in, kilawptaka na mel uh mu ding in ka pang sansan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na kiang ua hongpai ka tum chiltel ngal ua; kei, Paul ngei in leng hongpai ka tum tuma, himahleh Setan in a hondal nak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka lametna uleh, ka kipahna uhiam, ka lallukhu suan uhiam bang ahia leh? A hongpai chiang in i Toupa Jesu ma ah noumau mah na hi kei ding ua hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Noumau mah ka suan uleh ka kipahna uh na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi in ka thuakzoh taklouh phet un Athen khua ah koumau kia nutsiah in om le ung hoih ka sa uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />I unaupa uh Timothi bel Khrist Tanchinhoih lam a Pathian nasempa, nou hon hihkip ding leh na ginna lam ua nou hon khamuan ding in k’on sawlta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hiai gimthuaknate ziak a kuamah a linlouhna ding un. Hiaite bang thuak ding a seh ka hi uh chih noumau ngei in na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na kiang ua ka omlai un gimthuak ding ka hi uh chih k’on hilhkholh bang ngei in a tungta hi, huai na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hiaiziakin ka thuakzoh taklouh nung in, khempa’n nou a hon khempuk kha dia, ka sepgimna uh a thawn kha ding chi in, na gindan uh ka na theihna ding in mi k’on sawl ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Himahleh Timothi noumau a kipan a tua ka kiang uh a hongtun in, honmuh ka ut mahmah bang un nou leng honmuh ut mahmah in hehpih in n’on theigige uh chih leh, na ginna uh leh na itna tanchin uh kipahhuai takmai a hon puak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi a hih ziak in unaute aw, ka mangbatna uleh gimthuakna tengteng uah na ginna ziak un na tungthu uah lungmuan in ka omta uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa a na dinkip phot uleh tun tuh ka hingta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />I Pathian ma ah na tung ua ka kipahna tengteng ziak un noumau lamthu ah Pathian kiang ah bangchibang in kipahthu ka gen thei zawzen ding uam aw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na mel uh ka muh theihna ding uleh na ginna lam ua na taksap awng uh k’on huksak theihna ding un sun leh zan in nakpitak in ka thum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in Pathian, i Pa leh Toupa Jesu’n leng, koute na kiang uah honpi tung hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan noumau lam a itna ka hauh bang un, noumau khat leh khat na ki-ittuah chiatna uleh mi tengteng na itna uh hon khangsak zelpa Toupa’n hon hausak semsem hen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi a i Toupa Jesu a misiangthou tengteng toh a hongpai chiang a, i Pathian leh a Pa ma a na lungtangte uh siangthouna lam ah gensiatbeia om ding a nou a hon hihkip theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi in unaute aw, a tawppenin na omdan ding uleh Pathian na hih kipahdan ding uh tua na omdan bang uh, koumau a kipan a na lak bang un na hauhsemna ding un Toupa Jesu ah k’on ngen un k’on hanthawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa Jesu ziak in bangthute ahia k’on piak uh na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian deihlama na siangthouna ding uh hiai ahi: kingaih tawpsan unla;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Siangthou leh zahtakhuai in noumau zi chiat kem un
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian theilou Jentelte bang a huk lamsang a utlou in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huai lam thu ah zaw kuamah takhial in a unau tung ah thil hoihlou hihkei hen; Toupa huchibang thilhihte tengteng phulapa a hih ziak in k’on hilhkhol un k’on theisak khinta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian in sianglou ding in a honsam kei a, siangthou ding in a honsam zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huaiziak in a nial in mihing nial ahi kei a, Pathian nou a Kha Siangthou hon pepa nial ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A hihangin unaute itdan lamthu gelhsak na kiphamoh kei ua, ki-ittuah chiat ding in noumau ngei Pathian hilh in na omta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Masidonia gam a unau om tengteng tung ah huai na hihngei uhi. Himahleh unaute aw, na hauhsemna ding un k’on hanthawn uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kamsim deuh a om leh noumau nna chiat limsak leh, thu ka honpiak bang ua na khut ngei ua sep na tupna ding un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in pawlam mite tung ah kilawmtakin na om thei ding ua, bangmah na tasam kei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Himahleh unaute aw, midang lametna himhim neiloute bang a na lungkham louhna ding un, ihmute tungtang na theihlouh uh ka deihkei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jesu a si a, a thou nawnta chih i gingta ua, huchibang in Jesu a ihmu khinsate Pathian in amah toh a hon tonpih ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hiai Toupa thu in na kiang uah ka gen uhi; eite Toupa hongpai pha a hingdam a na omlaite’n, ihmu khinsate i makhelh kei hial ding hi, chih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Toupa mahmah kikou aw toh, angel tungnungpen aw toh, Pathian pengkul ging toh, van a kipan a hong paisuk ding ahi ngal a, huan Khrist a sisate a thou masa phot ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huaikhit chiang in eite hingdama na omlaite, huihkhua ah Toupa tuak ding in amau toh mei lak ah laktouh in i om ding ua; huchi in tangtawn in Toupa kiang ah i om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huaiziak in hiai thute in kikhamuan tuahchiat un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Himahleh naute aw, a hun leh a ni lam thute himhim gelhsak na kiphamoh kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa ni tuh zana guta bang in a hongtung ding chih noumau ngei in chiantak in na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Muanna leh bitna chi a a gen laitak un numei nauvei bang in thakhat in manthatna a tung uah a tung ding a, a suakta kei hial ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Himahleh unaute aw, nou zaw huai ni’n guta bang a a hon bingphawn ding in mial ah na omkei uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vak tate leh sun tate na hivek ngal ua; zan a mi i hi kei ua, mial a mi leng i hi sam kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huaiziak in midangte bang in i ihmu kei ding uh, hak ni in limsak zaw ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ihmute zan in ahi a ihmut uh; zukhamte leng zan in ahi a kham uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Himahleh eibel sun a mi i hih ziak in, ginna leh itna lum tawi in, hotdam lametna lukhu a zang in limsak zaw ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian in thangpaihna thuak ding hilou in, Toupa Jesu Khrist ziak a hotdamna mu ding zaw in a honchi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />I hah in leng i ihmut in leng, amah toh i hinkhawm theihna ding in i sih sik in amah a sita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huaiziak in ki hanthawn chiat in, na hihnak mah bang un kitungding tuah chiat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Himahleh unaute aw, na lak ua semgim leh Toupa a na heutu ua na om leh nou hon thuhilhte thei ding in k’on ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A nasep ziak un it in ngaithupi mahmah un. Noumau kituak in om un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuin unaute aw, k’on hanthawn uhi, danlou a omte hilh unla, lungkete hanthawn unla, hatloute panpih unla, mi tengteng lak ah thuakzou tak in om un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kuamah in kua gitlouh leng gitlouh a thuklou ding in pilvang un; thil na kihihsak tuahna lam uah leh mi tengteng tung a na hihsakna lam uah leng a hoih lamlam zui un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nuam gige un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tawplou in thum un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bangkim ah kipahthu gen gige un; huai tuh noumau lam a Khrist Jesu ah Pathian deihlam ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kha tuh phelh kei un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thugente simmawh kei un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bangkim enchian zaw unla, a hoihlam peuhmah len chinten un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Gilou lam peuhmah ah kihemkhia un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huchi in lemna Pathian ngei in nou honhih siangthou sipsip hen; na kha uh leh na lungsim uh leh na pumpi uh i Toupa Jesu Khrist hongpai chiang in gensiatbei in humbit in omsuak sipsip hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nou honsampa a muanhuai a, hih leng a hih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Unaute aw, hon thumsak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Unaute tengteng tawp siangthou in chibai hon na buksak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hiai laithon unau tengteng kiang ah sim ding in Toupa min in k’on ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />I Toupa Jesu Khrist hehpihna na kiang uah om hen, Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
